# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:4
translate turkish graduation_fcda8f21:

    # "That weekend, the time has come. I'm finally going to graduate."
    "O hafta sonu, zamanı geldi. Sonunda mezun olacağım."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:7
translate turkish graduation_9322fbe2:

    # "I'm pretty nervous. Not for the walking across the stage, but for what comes after."
    "Oldukça gerginim. Sahneye çıkacağım için değil, ondan sonra olacaklar için."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:8
translate turkish graduation_b5eb6fe8:

    # "I'm going to have to make a lot of decisions."
    "Bir sürü karar vermem gerekecek."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:9
translate turkish graduation_3c7f2f57:

    # "What career path I'm going to take."
    "Hangi kariyer yolunu seçeceğim."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:10
translate turkish graduation_292aaa1a:

    # "Where I'm going to live."
    "Nerede yaşayacağım."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:11
translate turkish graduation_6f7a21ba:

    # "And most importantly..."
    "Ve en önemlisi..."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:12
translate turkish graduation_6dec3447:

    # "... who I'm going to be with."
    "... kiminle birlikte olacağım."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:15
translate turkish graduation_bb5d5c1b:

    # "I see Jamie graduate. She looks so happy. Her dad cheers for her in the audience."
    "Jamie'nin mezuniyetini izliyorum. Çok mutlu görünüyor. Babası seyirciler arasından ona tezahürat ediyor."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:16
translate turkish graduation_ddb94435:

    # "I wonder who is here to cheer for me."
    "Acaba beni alkışlamak için kimler gelmiş?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:19
translate turkish graduation_c59ac221:

    # "When it's my turn, I walk across the stage to take my diploma."
    "Sıra bana geldiğinde, diplomamı almak için sahneye doğru yürüyorum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:21
translate turkish graduation_43c2c1fd:

    # "I hear a roar of applause and cheering from the crowd."
    "Kalabalıktan coşkulu bir alkış ve tezahürat sesi duyuyorum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:23
translate turkish graduation_ba624ddd:

    # "I hear people in the audience applauding and cheering for me."
    "Seyirciler arasında benim için alkışlayan ve tezahürat eden insanlar duyuyorum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:25
translate turkish graduation_50c87cd2:

    # "I hear a few claps and cheers from the audience."
    "Seyircilerden birkaç alkış ve tezahürat sesi duyuyorum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:27
translate turkish graduation_dc5c5344:

    # "The audience is embarrassingly quiet. I don't hear anybody cheering for me."
    "Seyirciler utanç verici derecede sessiz. Kimsenin benim için tezahürat ettiğini duymuyorum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:65
translate turkish graduation_a1216c7c:

    # "I look out and see my cheering section in the audience and give them a wave."
    "Etrafa bakınıyorum, seyirciler arasında beni destekleyen grubu görüyorum ve onlara el sallıyorum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:68
translate turkish graduation_379ce65b:

    # "The dean shakes my hand and gives me my diploma."
    "Dekan elimi sıkıyor ve diplomamı veriyor."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:69
translate turkish graduation_185e2b9c:

    # "I don't think I've ever met him before, but he looks so familiar."
    "Sanırım onunla daha önce hiç tanışmadım, ama bana çok tanıdık geliyor."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:72
translate turkish graduation_48469141:

    # "I can't believe I did it. Even with all the other things going on..."
    "Bunu başardığıma inanamıyorum. Başka onca şey varken bile..."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:73
translate turkish graduation_ca6a8913:

    # "... I graduated college."
    "... üniversiteden mezun oldum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:74
translate turkish graduation_464c98b1:

    # "It's a huge accomplishment."
    "Bu muazzam bir başarı."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:75
translate turkish graduation_9194429e:

    # "But now the real challenge begins. I have to live the rest of my life."
    "Ama asıl zorluk şimdi başlıyor. Hayatımın geri kalanını yaşamam gerekiyor."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:79
translate turkish graduation_88f825fa:

    # "And I have to make a choice."
    "Ve bir seçim yapmam gerekiyor."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:80
translate turkish graduation_35304928:

    # "After the ceremony finishes, I'm approached by people who want to congratulate me."
    "Tören bittikten sonra, beni tebrik etmek isteyen insanlar yanıma geliyor."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:86
translate turkish graduation_1b8bc31b:

    # sp "I'm so proud of you, [pcname]."
    sp "Seninle çok gurur duyuyorum, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:87
translate turkish graduation_edf6ed48:

    # sp "I know your father would be too."
    sp "Baban da gurur duyardı, biliyorum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:91
translate turkish graduation_ac0c2fb4:

    # ss "Wow, [bro]. You actually graduated!"
    ss "Vay canına, [bro]. Gerçekten mezun oldun!"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:92
translate turkish graduation_c8fc7fac:

    # ss "I'm so proud of you!"
    ss "Seninle çok gurur duyuyorum!"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:93
translate turkish graduation_e7a915a9:

    # tm "Yeah, good job [pcname]! Glad you didn't lose too many brain cells in the ring with me."
    tm "Evet, aferin [pcname]! Benimle ringde çok fazla beyin hücresi kaybetmediğine sevindim."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:97
translate turkish graduation_c04f8b26:

    # cw "Congratulations, [pcname]. I knew you could do it. You're so smart."
    cw "Tebrikler, [pcname]. Başarabileceğini biliyordum. Çok zekisin."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:101
translate turkish graduation_329f830b:

    # bs "Congratulations, [fuckboy]. Always knew you were smarter than you looked."
    bs "Tebrikler, [fuckboy]. Her zaman göründüğünden daha zeki olduğunu biliyordum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:102
translate turkish graduation_f878f94a:

    # pc "Thanks, Mrs. Mills. Are you going to stay to celebrate?"
    pc "Teşekkürler, Bayan Mills. Kutlama için kalacak mısınız?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:105
translate turkish graduation_3becdb7b:

    # bs "Nah, that's not for me. You have fun though."
    bs "Hayır, bu bana göre değil. Sen eğlenmene bak."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:106
translate turkish graduation_2d81c45d:

    # bs "Seriously... I'm proud of you and I hope you get everything you want out of life."
    bs "Cidden... Seninle gurur duyuyorum ve umarım hayattan istediğin her şeyi elde edersin."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:107
translate turkish graduation_4bd7bc94:

    # bs "Bye, [pcname]."
    bs "Hoşça kal, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:112
translate turkish graduation_d62fed7f:

    # gnd "Can you believe we actually did it?"
    gnd "Gerçekten başardığımıza inanabiliyor musun?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:113
translate turkish graduation_7af6eec9:

    # pc "Barely."
    pc "Zar zor."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:114
translate turkish graduation_70db59f2:

    # gnd "Thanks for all your help. I'm happy I get to walk across the stage with my best friend."
    gnd "Tüm yardımların için teşekkürler. En iyi arkadaşımla birlikte sahneden geçebileceğim için çok mutluyum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:118
translate turkish graduation_574568d3:

    # fr "Wow, [pcname]! You're a college graduate now!"
    fr "Vay canına, [pcname]! Artık bir üniversite mezunusun!"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:119
translate turkish graduation_d4964952:

    # fr "I'm so proud of you!"
    fr "Seninle çok gurur duyuyorum!"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:123
translate turkish graduation_81a7f5e2:

    # et "Congratulations, [pcname]. You did a great job this year."
    et "Tebrikler, [pcname]. Bu yıl harika bir iş çıkardın."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:124
translate turkish graduation_2ff53a2d:

    # mrmg "Yeah, Edie and I are both very proud of you."
    mrmg "Evet, Edie ve ben ikimiz de seninle çok gurur duyuyoruz."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:125
translate turkish graduation_046748d2:

    # pc "Thanks, you two."
    pc "Teşekkürler, ikinize de."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:128
translate turkish graduation_f61c3028:

    # mrmg "We're going to take off, but if you ever want to come by, feel free."
    mrmg "Biz artık gidiyoruz, ama ne zaman istersen uğrayabilirsin."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:129
translate turkish graduation_d3a78723:

    # et "Bye, [pcname]. I hope to see you again soon."
    et "Hoşça kal, [pcname]. Umarım yakında tekrar görüşürüz."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:134
translate turkish graduation_bece76e0:

    # bn "Congratulations, [pcname]! I'm happy that you were able to make it."
    bn "Tebrikler, [pcname]! Başardığına sevindim."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:135
translate turkish graduation_73f0d30c:

    # pc "Not sure I could have done it without some help on those essays."
    pc "O denemelerde biraz yardım olmasaydı başarabilir miydim, emin değilim."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:136
translate turkish graduation_a995bba0:

    # bn "You really have improved a lot since then. I'm glad I could help."
    bn "O zamandan beri gerçekten çok gelişmişsin. Yardımcı olabildiğime sevindim."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:140
translate turkish graduation_7379e0ab:

    # gl "Damn, Twig! You a college graduate now!"
    gl "Vay canına, Twig! Artık üniversite mezunusun!"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:141
translate turkish graduation_4d0b6de5:

    # gl "That's pretty fuckin cool. Good job, man."
    gl "Bu gerçekten çok havalı. Aferin dostum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:145
translate turkish graduation_c1d7fd4b:

    # sg "Wow, congratulations! I knew you could do it."
    sg "Vay canına, tebrikler! Yapabileceğini biliyordum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:146
translate turkish graduation_0cde929c:

    # sg "My [kdaddy] is super smart."
    sg "Benim [kdaddy]'im çok zeki."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:150
translate turkish graduation_25ea1d82:

    # gg "Good job [pcname]! I'm really proud of you."
    gg "Aferin [pcname]! Seninle gerçekten gurur duyuyorum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:154
translate turkish graduation_9bb0179c:

    # sst "Congratulations, [pcname]. I've seen how bright you are and I know you'll accomplish big things."
    sst "Tebrikler, [pcname]. Ne kadar zeki olduğunu gördüm ve büyük işler başaracağını biliyorum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:155
translate turkish graduation_cf39cc04:

    # sst "Plus... I'm not your teacher anymore, so I'm looking forward to spending a {i}lot{/i} more time with you."
    sst "Ayrıca... Artık senin öğretmenin değilim, bu yüzden seninle {i}çok{/i} daha fazla zaman geçirmeyi dört gözle bekliyorum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:159
translate turkish graduation_7758b810:

    # fd "Congratulations, [pcname]! What a big accomplishment."
    fd "Tebrikler, [pcname]! Ne büyük bir başarı."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:160
translate turkish graduation_e2fac1f5:

    # fd "So proud of you."
    fd "Seninle gurur duyuyorum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:164
translate turkish graduation_95a9907c:

    # rb "Dang, [pcname]! You graduated!"
    rb "Vay canına, [pcname]! Mezun oldun!"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:165
translate turkish graduation_193230c7:

    # rb "I'm super proud of you. I hope I can do that one day too."
    rb "Seninle çok gurur duyuyorum. Umarım bir gün ben de bunu başarabilirim."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:169
translate turkish graduation_3f04f91d:

    # wt "Congratulations, [pcname]. Now the real work begins."
    wt "Tebrikler, [pcname]. Artık asıl iş başlıyor."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:173
translate turkish graduation_99a6a955:

    # bai "Congratulations, [pcname]! I'm very proud of you."
    bai "Tebrikler, [pcname]! Seninle çok gurur duyuyorum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:177
translate turkish graduation_098f36f3:

    # det "Good job, [pcname]. I'm so proud of you."
    det "Aferin, [pcname]. Seninle çok gurur duyuyorum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:178
translate turkish graduation_ce2f89e3:

    # det "Plus, now I don't have to feel weird anymore about dating a guy who is still in school."
    det "Ayrıca, artık hâlâ okulda okuyan biriyle çıkmaktan dolayı kendimi garip hissetmeme gerek kalmadı."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:182
translate turkish graduation_1af6aa31:

    # mc "Congratulations, [pcname]. You have made a huge accomplishment today."
    mc "Tebrikler, [pcname]. Bugün büyük bir başarıya imza attın."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:183
translate turkish graduation_8189962e:

    # mc "Just one more step on a long and successful life."
    mc "Uzun ve başarılı bir hayatın sadece bir adımı daha."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:184
translate turkish graduation_e019ba6d:

    # mc "Oh I also wanted to tell you that Mrs. Spann has taken care of things. I do not have to go back to Korea until at least next year."
    mc "Ah, bir de sana şunu söylemek istemiştim: Bayan Spann her şeyi halletti. En azından gelecek yıla kadar Kore'ye dönmeme gerek yok."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:185
translate turkish graduation_e73708a0:

    # pc "That's great!"
    pc "Bu harika!"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:186
translate turkish graduation_aea2d457:

    # mc "Yes, I am very happy. I wanted you to know before you make your choice."
    mc "Evet, çok mutluyum. Kararını vermeden önce bunu bilmeni istedim."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:190
translate turkish graduation_3251ea55:

    # sc "Congratulations, [pcname]. I knew you could do it."
    sc "Tebrikler, [pcname]. Başarabileceğini biliyordum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:191
translate turkish graduation_5ef55c33:

    # pc "Thanks, Gertrude. Are you going to stay to celebrate?"
    pc "Teşekkürler, Gertrude. Kutlama için kalacak mısın?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:194
translate turkish graduation_d43e5efb:

    # sc "I'm sorry, but no. I hope you have a great time though."
    sc "Üzgünüm ama hayır. Yine de umarım harika vakit geçirirsin."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:195
translate turkish graduation_1d485803:

    # sc "I'm actually going to be leaving soon."
    sc "Aslında yakında ayrılacağım."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:196
translate turkish graduation_0d75ddc6:

    # pc "Leaving?"
    pc "Ayrılıyor musun?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:197
translate turkish graduation_5aba87b6:

    # sc "Yes, I'm going on a bit of a journey. But I'll keep in touch, I promise."
    sc "Evet, küçük bir yolculuğa çıkacağım. Ama haberleşmeye devam edeceğim, söz veriyorum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:200
translate turkish graduation_aaca6d60:

    # pc "Well, good luck. I hope you find what you're looking for... and I'll miss you."
    pc "Peki, iyi şanslar. Umarım aradığını bulursun... seni özleyeceğim."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:201
translate turkish graduation_55242658:

    # sc "I'll miss you too, [pcname]. Take care of yourself."
    sc "Ben de seni özleyeceğim, [pcname]. Kendine iyi bak."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:202
translate turkish graduation_6679f75b:

    # pc "Bye, Gertrude."
    pc "Hoşça kal, Gertrude."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:208
translate turkish graduation_ce23737e:

    # "So who do I want to celebrate with?"
    "Peki kiminle kutlama yapmak istiyorum?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20graduation.rpy:209
translate turkish graduation_cbc63806:

    # "I guess it's time to make my choice."
    "Sanırım seçim yapma zamanı geldi."

